MAIN RELATIONSHIPS:
- One user can have many transactions.
- One user can have many budgets.
- One category can belong to many transactions.
- One category can be used by many budgets.

BACKEND CONNECTION:
React Frontend
    ↓
Node.js + Express
    ↓
PostgreSQL (finuance database)

- The backend connects to PostgreSQL using the pg package.
- Database connection details are stored in backend/.env.
- DB_NAME=finuance tells the backend to use the Finuance database.
- The React frontend never connects directly to PostgreSQL.
- MongoDB is NOT being used in Finuance.

